digraph account_payable_process_64 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"file a copy for internal records" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"file a copy for internal records" -> "create a receiving report"
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_JVCI" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"create a receiving report" -> "OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_JVCI"
		"double check a three-way match" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_JVCI" -> "double check a three-way match"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_JVCI" -> "confirm all documents have been amended"
		"report errors to relevant team member" [shape=box]
		"OR_SPLIT--3. Document validation_JVCI" -> "report errors to relevant team member"
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_JVCI" [label=O fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"double check a three-way match" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_JVCI"
		"confirm all documents have been amended" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_JVCI"
		"report errors to relevant team member" -> "OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_JVCI"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"OR_JOIN--3. Document validation_JVCI" -> "stamp all documents"
	}
	START_NODE -> "file a copy for internal records"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"stamp all documents" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The text below is about the account payable process. It begins when you file a copy for internal records. 
When filing a copy for internal records is completed, creating a receiving report should be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, one or more of the following paths should be executed: doubling check a three-way match, confirming all documents have been amended, reporting errors to relevant team member. 
After that, you need to stamp all documents.
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the payee processes - it starts when you file a copy for internal documents.
When filing a copy of internal records is completed, a receiving report should be created.
Once a receipt report created, one or more of the following paths should be executed : doubling check a three-way match, confirming all documents have been amended and reporting errors to the appropriate team member.
After that you need to stamp all documents.
The process is now complete.
"
}
